flowchart TD
  U[Pet Owner] --> UI[Streamlit: Pets, Tasks, AI Planner]
  UI --> DB[(Session data: Owner / Pet / Task / VetVisit)]
  DB --> RET[Retriever: pending selected-day and overdue tasks]
  RET --> BASE[Rule-based baseline: priorities and conflicts]
  BASE --> G{AI mode selected and key provided?}
  G -->|No| LOCAL[Clearly labeled rules-only preview]
  G -->|Yes| LLM[OpenAI Responses API: grounded priority explanations]
  LLM --> VAL{Validate exact task IDs, complete coverage, priorities}
  VAL -->|Pass| RESULT[Validated AI suggestions]
  VAL -->|Fail or API error| LOCAL
  RESULT --> UI2[Results shown in Streamlit]
  LOCAL --> UI2
  UI2 --> H[Human reviews actions]
  H -->|Manually confirm completion| TASKS[Existing Scheduler controls]
  TASKS --> DB
  BASE --> LOG[Event logging]
  VAL --> LOG
  TEST[Pytest evaluation + fake model responses] --> RET
  TEST --> BASE
  TEST --> VAL
